        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Mr. T, Lawrence Tureaud, Jeff Fahey, Gary Busey, Carol Alt, Tony Nappo, Howie Mandel, Margot Kidder, Corbin Bernsen\n- Projects: Apocalypse (film series), The A-Team, Rocky III\n- Roles: B. A. Baracus, Clubber Lang\n\nFacts:\n- Mr. T was born as Lawrence Tureaud on May 21, 1952.\n- Mr. T is an American actor and retired professional wrestler.\n- In 1982, Mr. T played boxer Clubber Lang in the film Rocky III.\n- In the 1980s, Mr. T played B. A. Baracus in the television series The A-Team.\n- Mr. T was known for roles in Rocky III and The A-Team.\n- The Apocalypse film series included cast members Jeff Fahey, Gary Busey, Carol Alt, Tony Nappo, Howie Mandel, Margot Kidder, Corbin Bernsen, and Mr. T.",
